WEBVTT

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:03.896
to live a life
that is not defined by things.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.640
I call it "smalling up."

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:10.176
Smalling up is figuring out
what you really need

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.576
to feel contented and grounded.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:18.616
I have a friend who drives
really beat-up, raggedy cars,

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:24.296
but he will scrimp and save
15,000 dollars at one point

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.536
to buy a flute

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.800
because music is
what really matters to him.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:30.240
He smalled up.